                                "example_id": "1a8dcfd0-939f-4a79-b175-ee84ce79cce7",
                                "sense_id": "71f2501f-721a-3793-a1ca-e8ff65fceb97",
                                "text": "Their moderation may perhaps keep them from the bitter envyings and hatred, to which ambitious worldlings are subject […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "84ccc908-0beb-46c9-87e3-f5c092e5185e",
                                "sense_id": "71f2501f-721a-3793-a1ca-e8ff65fceb97",
                                "text": "\"What a small, worthless thing,\" exclaimed Henrietta, \"is our existence, filled with mean envyings, paltry hopes! and, if for one instant redeemed by a true affection, or a generous emotion, what wretchedness is sure to follow the indulgence of either!\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
